{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43556","headline":"西池落泉联句 · 裴度","name":"西池落泉联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东阁听泉落，能令野兴多。\n散时犹带沫，淙处即跳波。\n偏洗磷磷石，还惊泛泛鹅。\n色清尘不染，光白月相和。\n喷雪萦松竹，攒珠溅芰荷。\n对吟时合响，触树更摇柯。\n照圃红分药，侵阶绿浸莎。\n日斜车马散，余韵逐鸣珂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}